{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21024","headline":"野歌 · 李贺","name":"野歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鵶翎羽箭山桑弓，仰天射落衔芦鸿。\n麻衣黑肥冲北风，带酒日晚歌田中。\n男儿屈穷心不穷，枯荣不等嗔天公。\n寒风又变爲春柳，条条看即烟蒙蒙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21024.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21024","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}